#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A refund can't be undone. Check the transaction twice, and never refund the payment that bought the plan, or the user loses what they paid for."
msgstr "لا يمكن التراجع عن الاسترداد. راجع المعاملة مرتين، ولا تسترد أبدًا الدفعة التي اشترت الباقة، وإلا يفقد المستخدم ما دفع ثمنه."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All payments"
msgstr "كل المدفوعات"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "المبلغ"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Amount: what was really paid. It can differ from the plan's price."
msgstr "المبلغ: ما دُفع فعلًا. قد يختلف عن سعر الباقة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Couldn't load payments: %{reason}"
msgstr "تعذّر تحميل المدفوعات: %{reason}"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Find the payment in the table and copy its transaction."
msgstr "ابحث عن الدفعة في الجدول وانسخ معاملتها."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For example: a checkout for %{price} %{currency} was cancelled after an hour, then the user paid anyway. Nothing was given. Refund that payment."
msgstr "مثال: أُلغي طلب بمبلغ %{price} %{currency} بعد ساعة، ثم دفع المستخدم رغم ذلك. لم يُعطَ شيء. استرد هذه الدفعة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For example: order %{order} was paid by transactions %{first} and %{second}. The plan came from %{first}. Refund %{second} only, and the user keeps the plan."
msgstr "مثال: دُفع الطلب %{order} بمعاملتين هما %{first} و%{second}. جاءت الباقة من %{first}. استرد %{second} فقط ويحتفظ المستخدم بالباقة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How to refund"
msgstr "كيف تسترد"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Money arrived but nothing was given. You need to refund it."
msgstr "وصل المال لكن لم يُعطَ شيء. عليك استرداده."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Money that users paid for one-time plans. Payments that need a refund come first, so you can return that money in the payment provider's dashboard."
msgstr "أموال دفعها المستخدمون مقابل باقات لمرة واحدة. المدفوعات التي تحتاج استردادًا تأتي أولًا، لتعيد هذا المال من لوحة مزوّد الدفع."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Needs refund"
msgstr "تحتاج استردادًا"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Needs refund shows only the payments waiting for you. All payments shows every one-time payment, newest first."
msgstr "تحتاج استردادًا تعرض فقط المدفوعات التي تنتظرك. كل المدفوعات تعرض كل دفعة لمرة واحدة، الأحدث أولًا."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No payments yet."
msgstr "لا توجد مدفوعات بعد."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Nothing to refund."
msgstr "لا شيء لاسترداده."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open the payment provider's dashboard and refund that transaction there."
msgstr "افتح لوحة مزوّد الدفع واسترد تلك المعاملة هناك."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid"
msgstr "وقت الدفع"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid after the checkout was cancelled"
msgstr "دفع بعد إلغاء الطلب"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid after the checkout was cancelled."
msgstr "تم الدفع بعد إلغاء الطلب."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid after the checkout was cancelled: %{detail}"
msgstr "تم الدفع بعد إلغاء الطلب: %{detail}"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid twice for the same order"
msgstr "دفع مرتين لنفس الطلب"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid twice for the same order. Refund this second payment."
msgstr "تم الدفع مرتين لنفس الطلب. استرد هذه الدفعة الثانية."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid, and the plan was given."
msgstr "تم الدفع وأُعطيت الباقة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paid: when the money arrived."
msgstr "وقت الدفع: متى وصل المال."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Payments shown"
msgstr "المدفوعات المعروضة"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Payments that need a refund"
msgstr "مدفوعات تحتاج استردادًا"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "الباقة"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Provider order"
msgstr "طلب المزوّد"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Provider order: the checkout at the payment provider. Two payments for one order share it."
msgstr "طلب المزوّد: الطلب عند مزوّد الدفع. إذا دُفع طلب واحد مرتين فالدفعتان تشتركان فيه."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Refund reason: %{reason}"
msgstr "سبب الاسترداد: %{reason}"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Refunded by %{provider}"
msgstr "استرده %{provider}"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Showing the newest %{count} payment."
msgid_plural "Showing the newest %{count} payments."
msgstr[0] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."
msgstr[1] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."
msgstr[2] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."
msgstr[3] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."
msgstr[4] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."
msgstr[5] "عرض أحدث %{count} دفعة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Status"
msgstr "الحالة"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The checkout was closed before any money arrived."
msgstr "أُغلق الطلب قبل وصول أي مال."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The money was returned to the user."
msgstr "أُعيد المال إلى المستخدم."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The payment did not go through."
msgstr "لم تنجح عملية الدفع."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The payment that bought the plan"
msgstr "الدفعة التي اشترت الباقة"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The user paid after the checkout had already been cancelled or closed, so the money could not be used to buy the plan."
msgstr "دفع المستخدم بعد أن أُلغي الطلب أو أُغلق، فلم يمكن استخدام المال لشراء الباقة."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The user started the checkout but has not paid yet."
msgstr "بدأ المستخدم الطلب لكنه لم يدفع بعد."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The user was charged two times for one checkout, for example a double tap on Pay or paying by card and then by wallet. The first payment bought the plan and the second one waits here."
msgstr "خُصم من المستخدم مرتان لطلب واحد، مثل الضغط مرتين على زر الدفع أو الدفع بالبطاقة ثم بالمحفظة. الدفعة الأولى اشترت الباقة والثانية تنتظر هنا."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These payments reached us but bought nothing, so the user was charged for nothing."
msgstr "وصلتنا هذه المدفوعات لكنها لم تشترِ شيئًا، فخُصم من المستخدم مال بلا مقابل."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Transaction"
msgstr "المعاملة"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Transaction: the id of this one payment at the provider. Use it to find the payment when you refund."
msgstr "المعاملة: معرّف هذه الدفعة وحدها عند المزوّد. استخدمه للعثور على الدفعة عند الاسترداد."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "User"
msgstr "المستخدم"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "User: the buyer's id. Click it to open their account."
msgstr "المستخدم: معرّف المشتري. اضغط عليه لفتح حسابه."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What do the columns and statuses mean?"
msgstr "ماذا تعني الأعمدة والحالات؟"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When the provider reports the refund, the row turns refunded by itself. You do not need to change anything here."
msgstr "عندما يبلّغ المزوّد عن الاسترداد يتحول الصف إلى تم الاسترداد تلقائيًا. لا تحتاج إلى تغيير شيء هنا."

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Why"
msgstr "السبب"

#: lib/udin_billing/web/payments_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Why: the reason this payment needs your attention."
msgstr "السبب: لماذا تحتاج هذه الدفعة إلى انتباهك."

